                                                  <fo:inline>How
                                                  this guide applies</fo:inline>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                </fo:table-row>
                                            </fo:table-header><fo:table-body display-align="center">
                                                <fo:table-row display-align="center">
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" border-right-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>Technical writers and document authors</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>Primary authoring before submitting HTML files
                                                  for conversion.</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                </fo:table-row>
                                                <fo:table-row display-align="center">
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-right-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>DITA architects and consultants</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>Reference when reviewing or auditing source
                                                  documents before migration projects.</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                </fo:table-row>
                                            </fo:table-body></fo:table></fo:table-and-caption>
                                    </fo:block>
                                    <fo:block-container background-color="rgba(0 , 120 , 160 , 0.09)" background-image="url('file:/C:/Program%20Files/Oxygen%20XML%20Author%2028/frameworks/dita/DITA-OT/plugins/com.oxygenxml.webhelp.responsive/oxygen-webhelp/app/note.svg')" background-position-horizontal="0.5em" background-position-vertical="0.5em" background-repeat="no-repeat" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 120 , 160)" fox:border-after-start-radius="11px" fox:border-after-end-radius="11px" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" border-left-color="rgb(0 , 120 , 160)" border-left-style="solid" border-left-width="1px" margin-left="0" border-right-color="rgb(0 , 120 , 160)" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" margin-right="0" border-top-color="rgb(0 , 120 , 160)" fox:border-before-start-radius="11px" fox:border-before-end-radius="11px" border-top-style="solid" border-top-width="1px" space-after="1em" space-before="1em" role="Note" padding-bottom="0.75em" padding-left="3em" padding-right="0.5em" padding-top="0.75em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0"><fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-weight="700">Note:</fo:block> You must have basic
                                        working knowledge of HTML heading levels, links, tables,
                                        lists, images, and metadata. This guide assumes that you can
                                        inspect HTML in a browser and, when needed, in source
                                        view.</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                </fo:block></fo:block-container>
                            </fo:block>
                            <fo:block role="Sect" id="unique_5" xml:lang="en-us" chfox:nd-id="_Toc235450325">
                                <fo:block-container page-break-after="avoid" font-size="1.7em" space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em" role="H2" id="ariaid-title5"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0"><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d689e2238"/><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d689e2242"/><fo:inline background-color="transparent" color="transparent" font-size="0px" max-width="2px" vertical-align="super" id="d689e2246"/><fo:inline>Introduction</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                
                                <fo:block-container space-after="0" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="0"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">
                                    <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="0.5em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">The metR HTML to
                                        DITA converter does not rely on visual formatting alone. It
                                        reads</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                    <fo:block-container space-after="1em" space-before="1em" role="Sect"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">
                                        <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">The metR HTML
                                            to DITA converter does not rely on visual formatting
                                            alone. It reads structural information from HTML
                                            elements and semantic markup. When those elements are
                                            applied correctly, the converter and AI Agent can:</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                        <fo:list-block relative-align="baseline" provisional-label-separation="3pt" provisional-distance-between-starts="40px" space-after="1.33em" space-before="1.33em" id="unique_5_Connect_42_ul_09045101" chfox:nd-id="ul_09045101">
                                            <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">• </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>Generate a root Ditamap and child Ditamaps from the
                                                index file, ZIP folder name, or document title.</fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                            <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">• </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>Detect
                                                topic boundaries from heading levels and establish
                                                the Ditamap hierarchy.</fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                            <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">• </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>Classify topic types: concept (descriptive), task
                                                (procedural), reference (tabular or lookup), or
                                                troubleshooting.</fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                            <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">• </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>Convert paragraphs, lists, tables, images, links,
                                                inline formatting, and code blocks to valid DITA
                                                elements.</fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                            <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">• </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>Infer
                                                metadata — short descriptions, keywords, index
                                                terms, author, and revision history — from <fo:inline background-color="rgb(238 , 238 , 238)" color="rgb(128 , 0 , 0)" font-family="monospace" font-size="0.8em" role="Code" padding-bottom="2px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-top="2px">&lt;head&gt;</fo:inline> meta tags and structured body
                                                elements.</fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                            <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block text-align="end">• </fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>Flag
                                                issues such as missing short descriptions, invalid
                                                links, duplicate IDs, orphan topics, and improper
                                                nesting for human review.</fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
                                        </fo:list-block>
                                        <fo:block-container space-after="0.5em" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" space-before="1em"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0">The converter
                                            reads the following HTML constructs to accomplish this.
                                            Each is covered in a dedicated section of this
                                            guide:</fo:block></fo:block-container>
                                        <fo:block>
                                            <fo:table-and-caption border-collapse="collapse" id="d689e2291" space-before="1em" space-after="1em"><fo:table-caption start-indent="0" end-indent="0" keep-with-next="always"><fo:block-container page-break-after="avoid" font-weight="bold" margin-top="0.5em" text-align="left"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0"><fo:inline>Table<fo:inline> 2</fo:inline><fo:inline>. </fo:inline></fo:inline><fo:inline><fo:inline>Mandatory HTML constructs for
                                                  conversion</fo:inline></fo:inline></fo:block></fo:block-container></fo:table-caption><fo:table-caption-for-next-page start-indent="0" end-indent="0" keep-with-next="always"><fo:block-container page-break-after="avoid" font-weight="bold" margin-top="0.5em" text-align="left"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0"><fo:inline>Table<fo:inline> 2</fo:inline><fo:inline>. </fo:inline></fo:inline><fo:inline><fo:inline>Mandatory HTML constructs for
                                                  conversion</fo:inline></fo:inline><fo:inline> (continued)</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:block-container></fo:table-caption-for-next-page><fo:table relative-align="baseline" chfox:html-table-width-policy="yes" table-layout="auto" border-bottom-color="black" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" border-left-color="black" border-left-style="solid" border-left-width="1px" margin-left="0" border-right-color="black" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" margin-right="0" border-top-color="black" border-top-style="solid" border-top-width="1px" hyphenate="true" space-before="0" space-after="0"><fo:table-column/><fo:table-column/><fo:table-column/><fo:table-header font-weight="bold" text-align="center" display-align="center">
                                                  <fo:table-row display-align="center">
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" border-right-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" id="unique_5__d689e2291__entry__1"><fo:block>
                                                  <fo:inline>#</fo:inline>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" border-right-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" id="unique_5__d689e2291__entry__2"><fo:block>
                                                  <fo:inline>Mandatory HTML Construct</fo:inline>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" id="unique_5__d689e2291__entry__3"><fo:block>
                                                  <fo:inline>Role
                                                  in Conversion</fo:inline>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  </fo:table-row>
                                                </fo:table-header><fo:table-body display-align="center">
                                                  <fo:table-row display-align="center">
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" border-right-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>1</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" border-right-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>Index file title (<fo:inline background-color="rgb(238 , 238 , 238)" color="rgb(128 , 0 , 0)" font-family="monospace" font-size="0.8em" role="Code" padding-bottom="2px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-top="2px">index.html</fo:inline> or <fo:inline background-color="rgb(238 , 238 , 238)" color="rgb(128 , 0 , 0)" font-family="monospace" font-size="0.8em" role="Code" padding-bottom="2px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-top="2px">index.htm</fo:inline>)</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>Becomes the root Ditamap <fo:inline background-color="rgb(238 , 238 , 238)" color="rgb(128 , 0 , 0)" font-family="monospace" font-size="0.8em" role="Code" padding-bottom="2px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-top="2px">&lt;title&gt;</fo:inline> element. If no index file
                                                  exists, the ZIP folder name is used instead.</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  </fo:table-row>
                                                  <fo:table-row display-align="center">
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" border-right-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>2</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" border-right-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>Heading 1</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>Drives the Ditamap hierarchy and primary topic
                                                  boundaries.</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  </fo:table-row>
                                                  <fo:table-row display-align="center">
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" border-right-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>3</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" border-right-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>Heading 2 – Heading N</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>Each heading generates a separate child Ditamap
                                                  and a corresponding DITA topic, nested according
                                                  to heading level.</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  </fo:table-row>
                                                  <fo:table-row display-align="center">
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" border-right-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>4</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" border-right-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>Paragraphs</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>Maps to <fo:inline background-color="rgb(238 , 238 , 238)" color="rgb(128 , 0 , 0)" font-family="monospace" font-size="0.8em" role="Code" padding-bottom="2px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-top="2px">&lt;p&gt;</fo:inline> elements inside topic body
                                                  elements.</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  </fo:table-row>
                                                  <fo:table-row display-align="center">
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" border-right-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>5</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" border-right-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>Tables</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>Converts to <fo:inline background-color="rgb(238 , 238 , 238)" color="rgb(128 , 0 , 0)" font-family="monospace" font-size="0.8em" role="Code" padding-bottom="2px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-top="2px">&lt;simpletable&gt;</fo:inline> or to a CALS <fo:inline background-color="rgb(238 , 238 , 238)" color="rgb(128 , 0 , 0)" font-family="monospace" font-size="0.8em" role="Code" padding-bottom="2px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-top="2px">&lt;table&gt;</fo:inline> + <fo:inline background-color="rgb(238 , 238 , 238)" color="rgb(128 , 0 , 0)" font-family="monospace" font-size="0.8em" role="Code" padding-bottom="2px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-top="2px">&lt;tgroup&gt;</fo:inline>
                                                  </fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  </fo:table-row>
                                                  <fo:table-row display-align="center">
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" border-right-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>6</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" border-right-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-right-style="solid" border-right-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>Images and Graphics</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
                                                  <fo:table-cell start-indent="0" end-indent="0" border-bottom-color="rgb(0 , 0 , 0)" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-width="1px" padding-bottom="0.3em" padding-left="0.3em" padding-right="0.3em" padding-top="0.3em" display-align="before"><fo:block>Converts to DITA <fo:inline background-color="rgb(238 , 238 , 238)" color="rgb(128 , 0 , 0)" font-family="monospace" font-size="0.8em" role="Code" padding-bottom="2px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-top="2px">&lt;image&gt;</fo:inline> elements with optional <fo:inline background-color="rgb(238 , 238 , 238)" color="rgb(128 , 0 , 0)" font-family="monospace" font-size="0.8em" role="Code" padding-bottom="2px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-top="2px">&lt;alt&gt;</fo:inline> text. Block images are wrapped
