                                            used as a visual caption is mapped to a <fo:inline background-color="rgb(238 , 238 , 238)" color="rgb(128 , 0 , 0)" font-family="monospace" font-size="0.8em" role="Code" padding-bottom="2px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-top="2px">&lt;p&gt;</fo:inline> element, not a <fo:inline background-color="rgb(238 , 238 , 238)" color="rgb(128 , 0 , 0)" font-family="monospace" font-size="0.8em" role="Code" padding-bottom="2px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-top="2px">&lt;title&gt;</fo:inline>.</fo:block></fo:block-container>
