                                                  DITA</fo:inline></fo:inline></fo:block></fo:block-container></fo:table-caption><fo:table-caption-for-next-page start-indent="0" end-indent="0" keep-with-next="always"><fo:block-container page-break-after="avoid" font-weight="bold" margin-top="0.5em" text-align="left"><fo:block end-indent="0" start-indent="0"><fo:inline>Table<fo:inline> 74</fo:inline><fo:inline>. </fo:inline></fo:inline><fo:inline><fo:inline>Admonition patterns mapped to
