                                            the converter places it inside <fo:inline background-color="rgb(238 , 238 , 238)" color="rgb(128 , 0 , 0)" font-family="monospace" font-size="0.8em" role="Code" padding-bottom="2px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-top="2px">&lt;step&gt;&lt;info&gt;</fo:inline> as an <fo:inline background-color="rgb(238 , 238 , 238)" color="rgb(128 , 0 , 0)" font-family="monospace" font-size="0.8em" role="Code" padding-bottom="2px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-top="2px">&lt;equation-block&gt;</fo:inline>, binding it to the
